From ea2b1987a89d2841959101a56339a908af0339be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pyramid <pyramid@tempo.xyz>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:07:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(uniswap-v2): ERC20 transfer slice spec

Spec the ERC20 transfer from the solar-verify annotations: a
sequential post (debit the caller, then credit the recipient over the
debited state), the self-transfer case without a recipient overflow
check, the Transfer log and the true return, framed over the
footprint's slots. The VC is discharged over SolidCore runs under a
footprint-scoped keccak premise, with NonVacuous witnesses, concrete
self-transfer tests at 2^256-1 and below the amount, a Meets to bytes
lemma through Equiv, and three mutants (missing debit, wrong log,
wrong return) refuted by execution.
